									<code profiles="">set GD_Sage_Weapons.Name.Title.Title_Unique_Rex:AttributePresentationDefinition_8 NoConstraintText The Vault Hunters use the keys, but they are mere treasure hunters. Only I, Handsome Jack, know the true power of the Vaults.</code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Sage_Weapons.Name.Title.Title_Unique_Rex:AttributePresentationDefinition_8 NoConstraintText Look at them, they come to this place when they know they cannot win. The Vault Hunters use the keys, but they are mere treasure hunters. Only I, Handsome Jack, know the true power of the Vaults. We cannot blame these mercenaries, they are being lead by their own greed, oblivious to the secrets of the vaults. Now, i will stop them. Now i am cha-< -/></code>
