								<category name="Gubber (New)">
									<comment>3 Projectiles per shot, 3 ammo per shot, high mag size. Fires slow, arcing projectiles that ricochet from surfaces and between enemies. No standard sniper crit bonus, but instead gets higher base damage.</comment>
									<category name="Code">
										<comment>load_package GD_Siren_Streaming_SF</comment>
										<comment>clone -x GD_Weap_SniperRifles.Barrel.SR_Barrel_Vladof_Lyudmila GD_Weap_SniperRifles.Barrel.SR_Barrel_Dahl_Gubber</comment>
										<category name="Firing Mode">
											<comment>clone -x GD_Weap_SniperRifles.FiringModes.Bullet_Sniper_Default GD_Weap_SniperRifles.FiringModes.Bullet_Sniper_Gubber</comment>
