			<category name="Vault Hunters">
				<category name="Player Skill Point Limiter (MADE BY ZETADAEMON)">
					<comment>Makes it so you get your first skill point at level 2 instead of 5</comment>
					<comment>And makes you unable to get skill points after level 69</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>This grants you a total of 68 skill points, equal to the old 72</comment>
					<comment>level cap.</comment>
