						</category>
						<comment># --------------------------------------------</comment>
						<comment># This only affects the behaviour of Phaselock against targets that are immune to it.</comment>
						<comment># It does not change anything about the way Phaselock works with regular targets.</comment>
						<comment># After hitting a non-phaselockable target, Phaselock remains artificially active for the base phaselock duration of 5 seconds (not affected by Suspension).</comment>
						<comment># During that time, Chain Reaction, Elated, and Wreck are active (if specced into) and give all their bonuses.</comment>
						<comment># Phaselock cooldown will only start after this phase is finished (even if not specced into Wreck/Elated/Chain Reaction)</comment>
						<comment>#</comment>
						<comment># --------------------------------------------------------</comment>
						<category name="Delay Helios so that it happens after Converge and Ruin">
							<hotfix name="MayaSkillTweaks" package="GD_Siren_Streaming">
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0 BehaviorSequences[0].ConsolidatedOutputLinkData[67].ActivateDelay 2.000000</code>
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0 BehaviorSequences[0].BehaviorData2[42].LinkedVariables (ArrayIndexAndLength=0)</code>
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0 BehaviorSequences[0].BehaviorData2[82].LinkedVariables (ArrayIndexAndLength=0)</code>
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Delay_7 Delay 2.200000</code>
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Delay_11 Delay 2.200000</code>
							</hotfix>
						</category>
						<comment># --------------------------------------------------------</comment>
						<comment># This makes Helios proc 1.25 seconds later in the Phaselock chain of events.</comment>
						<comment># The initial Helios explosion should now happen after the target is slagged.</comment>
						<comment># To be honest, it really does not change much since about 80% of Helios' damage is in the Burn DOT (which did already benefit from Ruin's slag).</comment>
						<comment># What's probably a much bigger deal is that Helios now also happens after Converge, and may thus hit more enemies.</comment>
						<comment>#</comment>
						<comment># ------------------------------</comment>
						<category name="Give Helios its visual effect">
							<hotfix name="MayaSkillTweaks" package="GD_Siren_Streaming">
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0 BehaviorSequences[0].BehaviorData2[3].OutputLinks (ArrayIndexAndLength=0)</code>
								<code profiles="">set GD_Siren_Skills.Phaselock.ActionSkill_Phaselock:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0 BehaviorSequences[0].BehaviorData2[87].OutputLinks (ArrayIndexAndLength=131073)</code>
							</hotfix>
						</category>
						<comment># ------------------------------</comment>
						<comment># This is purely visual: fixed a bug (I think) that deleted what seem to be the visual effects intended for Helios.</comment>
					</category>
					<category name="Skill Trees">
						<category name="Motion">
							<hotfix name="SkillTree" package="GD_Siren_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Siren_Skills.SkillTree.Branch_Motion Tiers ((Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Ward',SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Accelerate'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Suspension',SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.KineticReflection'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Fleet',SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Converge',SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Inertia'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Cataclysm.ChainReaction'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.SubSequence',SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.Haste'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Siren_Skills.Motion.ThoughtLock'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=1))</code>
