								<hotfix name="a" package="GD_Mercenary_Streaming">
									<code profiles="">set GD_Mercenary_Skills.Gun_Lust.NoKillLikeOverkill SkillDescription Killing an enemy grants you a <font color="#fc3d03">multiplicative</font> [skill]Gun Damage[-skill] bonus for a short duration based on the amount of [skill]excess damage[-skill] you dealt to the enemy you just killed. This effect has a cap.</code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Mercenary_Skills.Gun_Lust.NoKillLikeOverkill SkillDescription Killing an enemy grants you [skill]added Gun Damage[-skill] for a short duration equal to the amount of [skill]excess damage[-skill] you dealt to the enemy you just killed. This effect has a cap.</code>
