									</hotfix>
								</category>
								<category name="Attacks changes">
									<comment>Deathtrap is no longer forced to face Gaige while attacking on all his attacks.</comment>
									<category name="Melee Attacks">
										<comment>Increased the animation speed of all DT's melee attacks by 50%, increased the maximum distance allowed for attacking from 256 to 384, increased the radius off all attacks from 386 to 579.</comment>
										<comment>Reduced minimum distance allowed for attacking from 80 to 0.  </comment>
										<comment>Changed the aimtype from AimType_AlignToTarget to AimType_FollowTarget, seems to make DT not forced to allign to a specific part on a target, just maker him better on large target overall.</comment>
										<hotfix name="Hotfix" package="GD_Tulip_Mechro_Streaming">
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.AI.WillowAIDef_DeathTrap:Action_FlyAnimAttack_28 bAttackFromOppositeSideOfMaster False</code>
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.AI.WillowAIDef_DeathTrap:Action_FlyAnimAttack_29 bAttackFromOppositeSideOfMaster False</code>
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.AI.WillowAIDef_DeathTrap:Action_FlyAnimAttack_30 bAttackFromOppositeSideOfMaster False</code>
