									</category>
									<category name="Shock Beam">
										<comment>Increased the minimum range so DT stay away at maximum from the targeted enemy, buffed the damage from 1.25 to 4.</comment>
										<hotfix name="Hotfix" package="GD_Tulip_Mechro_Streaming">
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.AI.WillowAIDef_DeathTrap:Action_FlyAnimAttack_17 Range (MinVal=2000.000000,MaxVal=9999.000000)</code>
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.Anims.Anim_DeathTrap_ArielAttack:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_FireBeam_3 DamagePerSecondFormula (BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.Balance.Init_DeathtrapNonWeaponDamage',BaseValueScaleConstant=4.000000)</code>
										</hotfix>
									</category>
									<category name="Robot Rampage">
										<comment>Shortened the recovery for the first and last part of the skill, increased the maximum distance allowed to use Robot Rampage from 256 to 384, increased the radius of the melee attack from 386 to 579.</comment>
										<hotfix name="Hotfix" package="GD_Tulip_Mechro_Streaming">
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.AI.WillowAIDef_DeathTrap:Action_FlyAnimAttack_20 Range (MinVal=0.000000,MaxVal=384.000000)</code>
											<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_DeathTrap.AI.WillowAIDef_DeathTrap:Action_FlyAnimAttack_20 AimType AimType_FollowTarget</code>
