									<code profiles="default">set GD_Tulip_Mechromancer_Skills.BestFriendsForever.PotentAsAPony SkillDescription Increases [skill]Maximum Health[-skill] for you and [skill]Deathtrap[-skill].<br><br>Whenever a skill in <font color = "#53C053">Best Friends Forever</font> [skill]reaches 5 points[-skill], your bullets gain a [skill]+5%[-skill] chance to [skill]ricochet to nearby enemies[-skill] whenever they hit walls or other objects.</code>
