									<code profiles="default">set GD_Lilac_Skills_Mania.Skills.ReleaseTheBeast SkillDescription Activating [skill]Buzz Axe Rampage[-skill] when at or below 33% of your max health remaining instantly refills your health and transforms you into a [skill]Badass Psycho Mutant[-skill]. While in this form you gain increased [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] and [skill]Damage Reduction[-skill]<br><br>Transforming makes you unable to end the rampage early, and gives the rampage a specific duration.<br>[funstat]<font color="#70FFFF">There is an ! next to the health bar when below 33%.</font>[-funstat]</code>
