									<code profiles="default">set GD_Lilac_Skills_Hellborn.Skills.FuelTheFire SkillDescription [skill]Kill Skill[-skill]. Killing an enemy increases your chances of causing [skill]Elemental Effects[-skill].<br>[funstat]<font color="#70FFFF">Chance to light yourself on fire when applying status effects to enemies.</font>[-funstat]<br><br>Whenever a skill in <font color = "#B93C43">Hellborn</font> [skill]reaches 5 points[-skill], you gain [skill]+10% Status Effect Duration[-skill].</code>
