							<category name="Flametongue (Delusional Damage)">
								<hotfix name="kroog" package="GD_Lilac_Psycho_Streaming">
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Lilac_Skills_Hellborn.Skills.DelusionalDamage SkillName Flametongue</code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Lilac_Skills_Hellborn.Skills.DelusionalDamage SkillDescription Hitting enemies with [skill]melee attacks[-skill] [incendiary]lights them on fire[-incendiary] and has a chance to [incendiary]light yourself on fire[-incendiary].<br><br>Ignite chances are determined by those accumulated from [skill]Burn, Baby, Burn[-skill] and [skill]Fuel the Fire[-skill].<br><br><font size="10">[incendiary]Fire damage dealt by this skill deals the same amount against all health types.[-incendiary]</font></code>
