				<category name="Increased Dedicated Legendary Chances">
					<comment>- Increases the chance of legendary loot pools dropping so     -</comment>
					<comment>- that each item within the pool has a ~10% chance of dropping -</comment>
					<comment>- instead of splitting 10% by the number of items in the pool. -</comment>
					<comment>- f.e 3 items in the pool, 30% chance to drop.                 -</comment>
					<comment>- Only affects pools that have more than 1 item inside them.   -</comment>
					<comment>- Some bosses were already changed within UCP's own loot       -</comment>
					<comment>- changes. They have been tweaked as a result to accommodate   -</comment>
