			<category name="Imported Mods">
				<comment>--- Everything in this category one way or another has been pulled from other ---</comment>
				<comment>--- mods, and *all* credits go to those who made these originally. These are  ---</comment>
				<comment>--- mainly things *i* personally think make the game better and more fun.     ---</comment>
				<category name="UHDElementalSniperFix">
					<comment>##########################################################################################################</comment>
					<comment>Restore missing glowing element effect to Sniper Rifles from the Ultra HD Texture Pack for Borderlands 2</comment>
					<comment>Made by PhantomNatsu (Natsu235)</comment>
					<comment>##########################################################################################################</comment>
					<comment>>> Note: Use this patch BEFORE any other to prevent skin breaking.</comment>
					<comment># Sniper Rifles #</comment>
