				</category>
				<category name="No More Orders">
					<comment>- By: Exotek</comment>
					<category name="DESCRIPTION_">
						<comment>- YOU DON'T NEED TO HAVE DOCTOR'S ORDERS MISSION ACTIVE ANYMORE IN ORDER TO FARM THE LOOT MIDGETS IN WEP.</comment>
						<comment>! NOTE</comment>
						<comment>- YOU NEED TO IMPORT THIS MOD THROUGH BLCMM TO MERGE THE HOTFIXES.</comment>
					</category>
					<category name="DEFINITION_">
						<hotfix name="EQ_NOORDERS" level="None">
							<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_Treasure.InteractiveObjectsTrap.MidgetHyperion.InteractiveObj_CardboardBox_MidgetHyperion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 LinkedMission MissionDefinition'GD_Episode02.M_Ep2a_MoreGuns'</code>
							<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_Treasure.InteractiveObjectsTrap.MidgetHyperion.InteractiveObj_CardboardBox_MidgetHyperion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 MissionStatesToLinkTo (bNotStarted=False,bActive=False,bRequiredObjectivesComplete=False,bReadyToTurnIn=False,bComplete=True,bFailed=False)</code>
							<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_Treasure.InteractiveObjectsTrap.MidgetHyperion.InteractiveObj_CardboardBox_MidgetHyperion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 bIsObjectiveSpecific False</code>
							<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_Treasure.InteractiveObjectsTrap.MidgetHyperion.InteractiveObj_CardboardBox_MidgetHyperion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 bInstanced False</code>
						</hotfix>
					</category>
				</category>
				<category name="No Space Cowboy">
					<comment>Removes the need for the space cowboy mission to be active for the loot midget to spawn in the toilet.</comment>
					<hotfix name="EQ_NOORDERS" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Anemone_Side_SpaceCowboy.InteractiveObjects.IO_ToiletMidget:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 LinkedMission MissionDefinition'GD_Episode02.M_Ep2a_MoreGuns'</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Anemone_Side_SpaceCowboy.InteractiveObjects.IO_ToiletMidget:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 bIsObjectiveSpecific False</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Anemone_Side_SpaceCowboy.InteractiveObjects.IO_ToiletMidget:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 bInstanced False</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Anemone_Side_SpaceCowboy.InteractiveObjects.IO_ToiletMidget:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.BehaviorSequenceEnableByMission_0 MissionStatesToLinkTo (bNotStarted=False,bActive=False,bRequiredObjectivesComplete=False,bReadyToTurnIn=False,bComplete=True,bFailed=False)</code>
					</hotfix>
				</category>
				<category name="Better Fast Travel">
					<comment>#############################################################</comment>
					<comment>#                                                           #</comment>
					<comment>#   Enable fast travels you are not supposed to travel to   #</comment>
					<comment>#                                                           #</comment>
					<comment>#############################################################</comment>
					<comment>#Edited by splitzle, made by Natsu235</comment>
					<comment>#Now all yellow fast travels are normal</comment>
					<comment># End of the Line</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Wilhelm bSendOnly False</code>
					<comment># Vault of the Warrior</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone3.Volcano_Boss_A bSendOnly False</code>
					<comment># Talon of God - The Altar</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone3.Volcano_Boss_B bSendOnly False</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone3.Volcano_Boss_B StationDisplayName Talon of God - The Altar</code>
					<comment># Bunker</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone2.Cliffs_Boss bSendOnly False</code>
					<comment># Bloodshot Ramparts</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone1.DamTop bSendOnly False</code>
					<comment># Windshear Waste</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone1.Glacial bSendOnly False</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_FastTravelStations.Zone1.Glacial StationDisplayName Southern Shelf - Windshear Waste</code>
					<comment># Magnys Escape</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Orchid_FastTravel.TopOfSpire bSendOnly False</code>
					<comment># H.S.S Terminus</comment>
