				<category name="LootMidgetWorld">
					<comment>By mopioid ( mopioid#0001 | twitch.tv/mopioid | @mopioid )</comment>
					<comment>osetor note:</comment>
					<comment>Removed Sanctuary, Terramorphous Peak, The Circles of Slaughter, Torgue's Arena,</comment>
					<comment>Digistruct peak, Leviathan's Lair, Windshear Waste, Vault of the Warrior,</comment>
					<comment>The Bunker and End of the Line</comment>
					<comment>as possible spawn locations for midgets</comment>
					<category name="Mod Content">
						<comment>Version 1.1.1</comment>
						<comment>Makes every applicable loot source in every map able to spawn a Loot Midget.</comment>
						<category name="Base Changes" locked="true">
							<category name="Disable Midget Spawn Limits">
								<hotfix name="LootMidgetWorld" level="None">
									<code profiles="default">set GD_LootMidget_CombatEngineer.Character.Pawn_LootMidget_CombatEngineer ActorSpawnCost 0</code>
