				<category name="Less Dumb Visuals">
					<comment>Less Dumb Visuals by MikeyRay and Freya</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>Credits:</comment>
					<comment>- Nocturni for letting me use certain parts of his splash mod</comment>
					<category name="Damage Over Time Screens">
						<category name="Corrosive">
